<title>CROATIA: Croatian revised Oct jobless 15.7 vs Sept 15.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Croatian revised Oct jobless 15.7 vs Sept 15.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Statistics Bureau issued the following economic indicator details. Previous figures are in brackets.</p>
<p> CROATIA UNEMPLOYMENT	 OCTOBER    SEPTEMBER     OCT '95</p>
<p> Total jobless		  267,619     262,203	244,442</p>
<p> Unemployment rate (pct)     15.7     15.3 (18.4)	17.3</p>
<p>NOTES -- Unemployment figures for September have been revised after the bureau included army, police and farmers in the total workforce. Data still exclude unemployed in Serb-held Eastern Slavonia.</p>
<p>-- Kolumbina Bencevic, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
